<% content_for :meta_title, "SMB Automation and Software Consulting Services | Doug Morgen" %>
<% content_for :meta_description, "Automation consulting, Rails applications, Shopify systems, internal tools, API integrations, data cleanup, and ongoing technical partnership for SMBs." %>

<section class="section-block">
  <div class="section-shell">
    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div class="rise-in">
        <p class="pill">Automation + software services</p>
        <h1 class="mt-5 text-4xl font-bold leading-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl">Practical software help for SMBs with complex operations.</h1>
        <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-700">I help businesses automate work, connect systems, build internal tools, improve Rails apps, and make Shopify operations less painful.</p>
        <p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-700">Sometimes that looks like a scoped build. Sometimes it looks like ongoing technical leadership. The point is to support your business goals, not force everything into a prepackaged service box.</p>

        <div class="mt-7 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
          <%= link_to "See case studies", work_path, class: "btn-secondary" %>
          <%= link_to "Read common questions", faq_path, class: "btn-secondary" %>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="rise-in">
        <%= render "inquiries/quick_form_cta" %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-block pt-0">
  <div class="section-shell">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 sm:text-3xl">What you can hire me for</h2>

    <div class="mt-6 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
      <article class="card">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Business process automation</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-slate-700">Turn recurring spreadsheet work, approvals, and handoffs into dependable workflows your team can use with confidence.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Internal tools and dashboards</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-slate-700">Build admin screens, reporting, operational dashboards, and custom tools around how the business really works.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Rails application consulting</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-slate-700">Feature delivery, architecture cleanup, performance work, production debugging, and modernization for Rails codebases that need momentum again.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Shopify and e-commerce systems</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-slate-700">Custom Shopify apps, order workflows, fulfillment tooling, customer operations, webhook pipelines, reporting, and revenue operations around your storefront.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">API integrations and data cleanup</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-slate-700">Connect the systems your business runs on, import and clean data, build reliable syncs, and make operational reporting trustworthy.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Ongoing technical leadership</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-slate-700">Senior judgment for roadmap tradeoffs, architecture, vendor decisions, team execution, and technical prioritization when you need steady help but not a full-time hire.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-block bg-slate-50/80">
  <div class="section-shell">
    <div class="card">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">Engagement formats</h2>
      <div class="mt-5 grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-3">
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Workflow diagnostic</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700">A focused first pass to map the opportunity, identify key risks, and decide what should happen next.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Scoped build or cleanup</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700">A practical project with clear outcomes: automate the flow, connect the systems, clean the data, or ship the feature.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Ongoing technical partner</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700">Regular senior help for businesses that need technical decisions and implementation to keep moving.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-6">
        <%= link_to "Get started", start_project_path, class: "btn-primary" %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
